<title>BELGIUM: Worried NATO says watching Albania closely.</title>
<headline>Worried NATO says watching Albania closely.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>NATO, expressing great worry over the increasing turmoil in Albania, said on Thursday it was watching events there closely.</p>
<p>A meeting of NATO's 16 ambassadors agreed a statement calling for political dialogue and end to violence. It made no mention of any intervention in the Balkan country.</p>
</text>
